- `gather_turn` is `E4070` at line 17: "`gather_turn` is `@deterministic`, and the threads started on lines 16 and 17 both run `receive`, which pushes to `INPUTS` (line 9) under `INPUT_LOCK`; which gets the lock first decides the list; join the first before starting the second: move line 18 above line 17".
